OverTheWire Bandit: Level 19 → 20

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 20.
A setuid binary allows execution of commands as the user bandit20.

Steps
Log in as bandit19:
ssh bandit19@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Execute the setuid binary to read the password file:
./bandit20-do cat /etc/bandit_pass/bandit20

Result
The command outputs the password for Bandit Level 20.
